<h2>What it tastes like</h2>
  <p>Think of a brownie sundae blended into one cup. The brownie pieces are dense and chewy, the chocolate chunks add a little snap, and the fudge makes it taste like dark chocolate. It is less sweet than the <a href="/items/brownie-batter-blizzard">Brownie Batter Blizzard</a>.</p>
  <h2>How it compares</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Blizzard</th><th>Small price</th><th>Small calories</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Choco Brownie Extreme</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.79</td><td>740</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/items/brownie-batter-blizzard">Brownie Batter</a></td><td class="price-cell">$4.79</td><td>530</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard">Cookie Dough</a></td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>710</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo</a></td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>490</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  <p>Brownie Batter is sweeter and softer at the same price.</p>
  <h2>Ordering tips</h2>
  <ul><li>New to it? Get a Mini first. It is rich.</li><li>Want even more chocolate? Ask for extra fudge; there is usually a small charge.</li><li>Sharing? A Medium is about 980 calories and splits well.</li><li>Many stores make Blizzard cakes in this flavor; see <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ cake sizes and prices</a>.</li></ul>
